<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Trump claimed US will end military aid to Israel by year end. Gunfire damaged tents at the Rafah displacement site as aid teams prepared for winter storms, and families are facing winter in tents on the beach in Gaza. Gaza is converting rubble into power using homemade wind turbines while former Israeli generals are assisting Palestinian olive farmers. Herzog warned Netanyahu of settler violence in the West Bank, and Shin Bet and the IDF knew Hamas’s military chief had gone underground hours before Oct. 7. 21,440 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/03/donald-trump-usa-end-military-aid-to-israel-end-year-midterms&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168707&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxOTHFiYWdzMlAzcWpVREhpWjZxOGNuQ3pqc05BVVpCOXo5RldWdHFhczBEUlFqc0VkelExemp6N19jaUc4bzZvdXFMWDd6b1NwSk9NWXNNc1VXcy1XZnBJM0M2YTJ5cUtDT2dKcGhmb3BTTWRUUFZOX3RzbDU0Nl83aWZDLW1uYnB0LTVHLUdoYWVNNWVOWE1UMmlFMFdUVlFHeGR3cnRhbHY2OWNjNmRDd1FhNFdObkVnZFFaVTFoVHJEUFA2YWh1Q2NGNWt1dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new